#: 7933db76297440719d0cc3be6c485151
msgid "**Q-transform**: Transients with scale-dependent resolution"
msgstr "**Q 変換**：スケール依存の分解能を持つ過渡現象"

#: ../../how-to/spectral/time_frequency_analysis_comparison.ipynb:10016
