msgstr "**HHT**：非定常な AM/FM 信号の瞬時周波数"

#: ../../how-to/spectral/time_frequency_analysis_comparison.ipynb:10018
#: 324a0d5a08da41b8b1b9f11a2d0d7fd6
msgid "**STLT**: Damped oscillations with decay rate information"
msgstr "**STLT**：減衰率の情報を伴う減衰振動"

#: ../../how-to/spectral/time_frequency_analysis_comparison.ipynb:10019
#: 215509c196ff41c391246bf2138de9f0
msgid "**Cepstrum**: Echo detection and periodicity in spectrum"
msgstr "**ケプストラム**：エコー検出とスペクトルの周期性"

#: ../../how-to/spectral/time_frequency_analysis_comparison.ipynb:10020
#: d7788cf79f594f79812b5e9a51d293ff
msgid "**DCT**: Signal compression and smooth feature extraction"
msgstr "**DCT**：信号圧縮と滑らかな特徴抽出"

