#: ../../how-to/spectral/time_frequency_analysis_comparison.ipynb:70004
#: 18f94dc65bde4ffba9892a3f94e7c00e
msgid "4.1 STFT (Spectrogram) - gwpy"
msgstr "4.1 STFT（スペクトログラム） - gwpy"

#: ../../how-to/spectral/time_frequency_analysis_comparison.ipynb:90002
#: 5cd5fd0b348a434fbb9109c06430b75a
msgid "4.2 Q-transform - gwpy"
msgstr "4.2 Q 変換 - gwpy"

#: ../../how-to/spectral/time_frequency_analysis_comparison.ipynb:110002
#: f7ff00c913bc44b9bc7d8bad336cc813
msgid "5. \"Winning Story\" Scenarios"
msgstr "5\\. 「勝ちパターン」シナリオ"

#: ../../how-to/spectral/time_frequency_analysis_comparison.ipynb:110004
#: ea30b3265fc34781a5132e195fd0e612
msgid "5.1 Wavelet (CWT): Scale-Varying Chirps"
msgstr "5.1 ウェーブレット（CWT）：スケールが変化するチャープ"

#: ../../how-to/spectral/time_frequency_analysis_comparison.ipynb:110006
#: ../../how-to/spectral/time_frequency_analysis_comparison.ipynb:130004
#: ../../how-to/spectral/time_frequency_analysis_comparison.ipynb:150004
#: ../../how-to/spectral/time_frequency_analysis_comparison.ipynb:170004
#: ../../how-to/spectral/time_frequency_analysis_comparison.ipynb:190004
#: 2c35b8d5edec49e9bef3c6c91cc5cbab 396cbaf0ea41412e9cfa068d3461483c
#: 64457ea7690541dd94fb5bfdd83bd939 6e2139479239461f859340ce7c4ef7f2
#: d982b615bcaf4eb69c2910b6871eac80
msgid "Signal Design"
msgstr "信号設計"

#: ../../how-to/spectral/time_frequency_analysis_comparison.ipynb:110008
#: 2d2448f5423540bca4c32219156412dd
msgid ""
"Chirps naturally match wavelet scales. We use our benchmark's chirp "
"component (20→150 Hz over 3s)."
msgstr "チャープはウェーブレットのスケールと自然に一致します。ベンチマークのチャープ成分（3 秒で 20→150 Hz）を使用します。"

#: ../../how-to/spectral/time_frequency_analysis_comparison.ipynb:110010
#: ../../how-to/spectral/time_frequency_analysis_comparison.ipynb:130008
#: ../../how-to/spectral/time_frequency_analysis_comparison.ipynb:150008
#: ../../how-to/spectral/time_frequency_analysis_comparison.ipynb:170008
#: ../../how-to/spectral/time_frequency_analysis_comparison.ipynb:190008
#: 0d1fa804781d4b268be618bf58ffece3 20c60bad12414beaafecd176c65daecb
#: 3b2b4133ec054046917c414a6ed6a4ca 50f5f3fc94fc4560af50f1f238bd9d9f
#: 812c3900d98844998c371216b4890ba0
msgid "What STFT/Q Cannot Show Clearly"
msgstr "STFT/Q が明確に示せないもの"

#: ../../how-to/spectral/time_frequency_analysis_comparison.ipynb:110012
#: 802a739c019b4d42be8590b166087ba1
msgid ""
"STFT has fixed time-frequency resolution (uncertainty principle). "
"Q-transform improves this but still shows a \"band\" rather than a precise "
"frequency trajectory."
msgstr "STFT は時間周波数分解能が固定です（不確定性原理）。Q 変換はこれを改善しますが、正確な周波数軌跡ではなく依然として「帯」を示します。"

#: ../../how-to/spectral/time_frequency_analysis_comparison.ipynb:130002
#: f02752462a824da297d40241fefcc6c8
msgid "5.2 HHT: Instantaneous Frequency for Non-Stationary Signals"
msgstr "5.2 HHT：非定常信号の瞬時周波数"

#: ../../how-to/spectral/time_frequency_analysis_comparison.ipynb:130006
#: e4d6503f4a1549f0ac3220db7c124d49
msgid ""
"AM/FM modulated signal where true instantaneous frequency varies smoothly. "
"We use a frequency-modulated tone with amplitude modulation."
msgstr "真の瞬時周波数が滑らかに変化する AM/FM 変調信号です。振幅変調を伴う周波数変調トーンを使用します。"

#: ../../how-to/spectral/time_frequency_analysis_comparison.ipynb:130010
#: fae601fa86fc4dde98c1af73747eb086
msgid ""
"STFT/Q show time-frequency \"bands\" with width. HHT extracts instantaneous "
"frequency as a **single-valued function of time**."
msgstr "STFT/Q は幅を持つ時間周波数の「帯」を示します。HHT は瞬時周波数を**時間の一価関数**として抽出します。"

#: ../../how-to/spectral/time_frequency_analysis_comparison.ipynb:150002
#: 7f6d3c09a0b347aeb5c49ba0efde567a
msgid "5.3 STLT: Damped Oscillations with Decay Rate Information"
msgstr "5.3 STLT：減衰率情報を伴う減衰振動"

#: ../../how-to/spectral/time_frequency_analysis_comparison.ipynb:150006
#: 3d431e6d6e5648aab2a635336b5d100a
msgid ""
"Multiple exponentially damped sinusoids with different decay rates. "
"Simulates ringdown modes with varying quality factors."
msgstr "減衰率の異なる複数の指数減衰正弦波です。さまざまな Q 値を持つリングダウンモードを模擬します。"

#: ../../how-to/spectral/time_frequency_analysis_comparison.ipynb:150010
#: 0e2ac59aeef34ec19ed9ee00de0e5b0c
msgid ""
"STFT and Q-transform only show **frequency** content. The **decay rate σ** "
"(damping coefficient) is invisible. STLT decomposes signals into both "
"frequency ω and decay rate σ."
msgstr ""
"STFT と Q 変換は**周波数**成分のみを示します。**減衰率 σ**（減衰係数）は見えません。STLT は信号を周波数 ω と減衰率 σ "
"の両方に分解します。"

#: ../../how-to/spectral/time_frequency_analysis_comparison.ipynb:170002
#: 44cdf464e5d8431fa865c29714daf773
msgid "5.4 Cepstrum: Echo Detection and Spectral Periodicity"
msgstr "5.4 ケプストラム：エコー検出とスペクトル周期性"

#: ../../how-to/spectral/time_frequency_analysis_comparison.ipynb:170006
#: f2d8827618574083b8cdea61586162f1
msgid ""
"Signal with a delayed copy (echo). Common in seismic noise when waves "
"reflect off structures."
msgstr "遅延した複製（エコー）を含む信号です。波が構造物で反射する地震ノイズでよく見られます。"

#: ../../how-to/spectral/time_frequency_analysis_comparison.ipynb:170010
#: c413fa0e8f0e4142a2924b694990fd09
msgid ""
"Echoes create **periodic structure in the spectrum** (comb filtering). STFT "
"shows this as fine ripples but delay time is hard to read. Cepstrum converts"
" spectral periodicity → time-domain peak at delay (\"quefrency\")."
msgstr ""
"エコーは**スペクトルに周期構造**を作ります（くし形フィルタリング）。STFT "
"はこれを細かいリップルとして示しますが、遅延時間は読み取りにくいです。ケプストラムはスペクトルの周期性を遅延位置の時間領域ピーク（「ケフレンシ」）に変換します。"

#: ../../how-to/spectral/time_frequency_analysis_comparison.ipynb:190002
#: e33e6c27074546278075fa21f3b9d815
msgid "5.5 DCT: Compression and Smooth Feature Extraction"
msgstr "5.5 DCT：圧縮と滑らかな特徴抽出"

#: ../../how-to/spectral/time_frequency_analysis_comparison.ipynb:190006
#: f3dce13779b1426e898170e78f85f0a1
msgid ""
"Smooth signal with small perturbations. Simulates slowly-varying background "
"trend with fine structure."
msgstr "小さな摂動を伴う滑らかな信号です。微細構造を持つゆっくり変化する背景トレンドを模擬します。"

#: ../../how-to/spectral/time_frequency_analysis_comparison.ipynb:190010
#: d4a82248934344928d2b3ddbd3220a41
msgid ""
"STFT/Q provide full time-frequency information but no compression. DCT "
"(Discrete Cosine Transform) reveals that **most signal energy concentrates "
"in a few low-frequency coefficients**."
msgstr ""
"STFT/Q "
"は完全な時間周波数情報を与えますが、圧縮はしません。DCT（離散コサイン変換）は、**信号エネルギーの大半が少数の低周波係数に集中する**ことを明らかにします。"

#: ../../how-to/spectral/time_frequency_analysis_comparison.ipynb:220002
